# Quill editors (admin)

## Every editor gets @mentions

- Import **`APP_QUILL_IMPORTS`** and use **`<app-quill-editor>`** (not bare `quill-editor` / `QuillModule`).
- Optional inputs on `<app-quill-editor>`:
  - `mentionClientId` — organization scope (contacts, org tasks/projects).
  - `mentionProjectId` — Task Manager project scope (members + tasks).
  - `mentionContext="activity"` — activity log: org people, invoices, projects; **tasks only after 2+ typed chars** (`GET /mentions/candidates?context=activity&clientId=`).
  - `mentionToolbar` — `full` (default), `minimal`, or `false` (comments).

## Data + display

- API: `GET /mentions/candidates` — list order is **people first** (users, contacts), then tasks/projects.
- Read-only HTML: **`quillHtmlForDisplay`** in `quill-utils.ts` (task/project links).

## Paste (clipboard)

- **`quill-paste-clipboard.ts`** + `QuillPasteService`: in-app record URLs (task, TM/CRM project, organization, invoice, person) → `mention` embed with API title (not the raw URL).
- Parsers: `quill-app-record-deep-link.util.ts`, `quill-link-paste.util.ts`.

## Do not

- Bare `<quill-editor>` on feature pages (use `<app-quill-editor>`).
- Hand-roll `quill-mention` `source` callbacks per screen.
